==Description==
'''Poor Titus''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Null & Void Event]]. It was obtained from Level 29 of the premium track, which had a cost of {{GumDrops|795}} or {{Robux|60}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|10,520}} or {{Robux|1,923}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|75}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|2,418}}.

==Appearance==
'''Poor Titus''' showcases dead [[Titus]] laying on the ground. When used, it plays a sound of [[Titus]] saying "''I'm dead. No big surprise.''".

==Trivia==
*The description of this sticker is a reference to [[Titus (Narrator)|Titus]]' dialogue in [[Failed Gateway]] "''I must say, I'm unimpressed.''", which is a popular meme in Tower Defense Simulator's community.
*The sound played when the sticker is used is a reference to a voiceline said by Heavy from ''Team Fortress 2''.
*This sticker is based on [[w:c:dragonball:Yamcha|Yamcha's]] infamous [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/yamchas-death-pose death pose].

